  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So i have a simple solution that could help creators to stop there models from being stolen and that is a new Component that i call VRC_NameTrigger. There should be 2 toggles that this component offers. IsUser. and IsNotUser pretty much if IsUser is checked it does nothing or if IsNotUser is checked it gives us the ability to play an animation. So for example if the user with the avatar is not my self then i can make an animation that disables the mesh renderer and then displays text that says \"This user has a stolen model!\" Honestly i do not think this would be to hard to add. And you can could even use the same trigger for worlds to make admin only areas.",
